Report Details Update – Description & Last Renewal

Certificate Description:

The dashboard currently derives a brief description from the following fields:
Certificate Owner – identifies the owning team or SRE group
Common Name (CN) – identifies the certificate/service name
Subject Alternative Name (SAN) – identifies DNS names or endpoints covered
Feedback from tower owners (Kevin, Bhargav, Hari) confirms that this view provides adequate context.
Short-term, no new calculated field is available; a new description field may be implemented once Chad Niemi from ServiceNow is available.

Last Renewal Date:

The Issued field in u_cmdb_certificate is used to track the last renewal date for each certificate.
Proposed display label for clarity: “Last Renewed / Issued Date”.
ServiceNow team will confirm if renaming the field is possible.

Implementation Notes:

Both Certificate Description and Last Renewal Date are included in the dashboard to provide leadership and tower owners with clear visibility of certificate context and renewal status.
These fields are already available in the dashboard view and do not require additional CMDB modifications at this time.
Future updates may include a dedicated calculated field for description once ServiceNow confirms feasibility.
